  "definition_ja": "2 点を結ぶ線分の長さ。座標平面では √((x₂ − x₁)² + (y₂ − y₁)²)。点と図形の距離は、最も近い点までの長さ。",
  "definition_en": "The length of the segment joining two points, √((x₂ − x₁)² + (y₂ − y₁)²) on the coordinate plane; from a point to a figure, the length to its closest point.",
  "latex": "\\sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2}",
  "spoken_en": "the square root of x two minus x one squared plus y two minus y one squared",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "The distance is always positive, so take the absolute value.",
      "ja": "距離はいつも正なので、絶対値をとる。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Find the distance between the points A(−1, 3) and B(5, −5).",
